Dia akan mendorongmu ke dinding
dan saat dia mendekat--

468
00:27:06.709 --> 00:27:08.961
-Potong.
-Memotong.

469
00:27:09.045 --> 00:27:10.379
Aku akan menelepon potong.

470
00:27:12.048 --> 00:27:12.882
Tidak apa-apa, kan?

471
00:27:13.758 --> 00:27:15.301
Ya, tidak apa-apa.

472
00:27:15.384 --> 00:27:16.302
Oke.

473
